    "title": "More Baby Essentials",
    "body_html": "<p data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"528\">Discover baby essentials for every stage of your little one’s day at Nestacular. This collection brings together carefully selected products beyond feeding, including bath time, baby care, playtime, learning, comfort, and everyday baby must-haves.</p>\n<p data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"840\">Whether you’re looking for practical daily essentials, thoughtful parent-friendly finds, or lovely additions to your baby’s routine, our Baby Essentials collection is designed to help make life a little easier. From useful basics to comforting favourites, each item is chosen with both baby and parent in mind.</p>\n<p data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"985\">Explore quality baby essentials that support everyday routines, encourage happy moments, and help you care for your little one with confidence.</p>",
    "products_count": 3
  },
  "products": [
    {
      "id": 10311190380886,
      "title": "Nestacular Bath Bomb Balls",
      "body_html": "The nightly struggle to get your little ones into the bathtub is a universal parenting hurdle. Between the protests, the stalling, and the occasional tears, what should be a calming end to the day often feels like a battle of wills. It’s exhausting to spend your final burst of evening energy coaxing a reluctant child into the water when all you want is a moment of peace.\n\nThis collection was designed specifically for parents and grandparents who are tired of the \"bath time blues\" and want to reclaim their evenings. If you have a child who views washing up as a chore rather than a joy, this is the solution you’ve been looking for. By turning a routine task into an interactive treasure hunt, you stop being the \"enforcer\" and start being the architect of their favorite daily adventure.\n\n### How the Magic Happens\nThis isn’t your average fizzing ball that disappears in seconds. Once dropped into the water, it erupts into a vibrant, swirling oasis of \"mega bubbles\"—a rare, frothy foam that sets this experience apart from standard options. As the bubbles grow and the water transforms into a kaleidoscope of color, a hidden surprise begins to emerge. Inside every single one is a high-quality, durable PVC animal friend—ranging from jungle explorers to deep-sea creatures—waiting to be discovered, played with, and collected.\n\n### Why You (and Your Kids) Will Love It\n*   **The \"Mega Bubble\" Magic:** Unlike most options that just fizz and fade, these create a thick, long-lasting foam that keeps kids engaged and playing happily while you finally catch your breath.\n*   **A New Discovery Every Time:** With 12 unique scents and 12 different animal toys to collect, the novelty never wears off. Your child will actually look forward to seeing which \"secret friend\" they’ll find next.\n*   **Zero-Stress Clean Up:** We know you don’t have time to scrub the tub after the kids are in bed. The \"No-Mess\" formula is designed to dissolve completely, leaving zero stains, no oily residue, and no ring around the porcelain.\n*   **Gentle &amp; Skin-Conscious:** Crafted with natural ingredients, these provide a soothing soak that is kind to sensitive young skin, giving you total peace of mind while they play.\n*   **The Ultimate Sensory Transition:** The 12 varied scents are pleasant and calming, helping to transition your child from high-energy play to a relaxed, sleepy state.\n\n### From Chaos to Calm\nThe emotional shift in your household will be immediate. Imagine the look of pure wonder on your child’s face as they watch the water come alive. Instead of chasing them down the hallway, you’ll find them waiting by the tub, eager to start their \"treasure hunt.\" You get to trade the stress and noise for giggles and curiosity. It turns a mandatory task into a bonding moment, leaving your child clean, happy, and clutching a new favorite toy.\n\n### The Quality Difference\nWhat truly sets this apart from the cheap alternatives found in big-box stores is the quality of the reward and the integrity of the ingredients. Most \"surprise\" products include flimsy, breakable trinkets that end up in the trash by morning. These toys are genuine collectibles made from high-quality PVC, built to survive hours of imaginative play in and out of the water. Combined with a formula that prioritizes both massive bubble production and a stain-free tub, you are choosing a premium experience that respects both your child’s skin and your valuable time.",
